rooms_desc ({"Suddenly you found yourself standing on vast huge plains, seeing thehorizon far away. All around there is weed growing above your height.You hack through the foliage but you find nothing but another weed.After a long time you spot a flashing light move quickly on the sky.You remembered that to the east there should be a big internationalairport where you sent your parents last year. To the west you seepretty high hills separating this country from the hell. You can hearsome weird noises come from north momentarily, but you're notinterested in sex, are you? You also noticed two pipes with signsstretching from the ground, one to the church and other to the shop.","You arrived at the top of the valley. You can see a large plain fullof weeds to the south while to the southwest you noticed high murkymountains called High Tislagsux. You shiver with fear as you watch thecloudy atmosphere above it. All of a sudden you heard a strange soundcoming from the east. You recognized a Boeing 747 landing on the runwayof the Int. Airport Old York. There is also a path through theweeds leading south.","You made it to a place with a sign. You hate all the mosquitos, butyou are helpless and all you can do is just hope they wont eat you alive.The mountain forest is much denser to the west while to the east you cansee large plains stretching to infinity. Suddenly you heard someone justfired a full clip of a M14. You hide behind a big bush and you saw a regimentof black dressed soldiers running quickly in the western direction. Fromthat moment on you heard guns firing and men yelling orders until you heardan awesome yelling of many people and shouts for help. Then the forest becomesilent again. You also saw blood stains and about 18mm bullets lying all around.","You are in the Morningsir's workroom. It is evidently placed inside theSun and you feel you ass make rough sounds and smells as it slowly gets friedin this terrible heat. There is one more thing interesting in this room:You can see a mirror in which you better don't dare to look.","Yeah, you happily made it in this asshole! You can see an exit leadingout south, but the ass is closed right now, try later. :]","You have just arrived to the International Old York Airport. There isnothing more than a high control tower and a pretty dirty runway witha lot of old crap lying in piles on it. You wonder why the runway isonly 30 metres long but miles wide!?! :) Suddenly you hear a buzzing sound coming from your six and yelling something about may days...Heh, the crash was cool, but the pilot hit the silk. Lucky guy! *grin*The more you watch the sky the less you can see with your blinded eyes.But alas! You saw him at least! HE MUST HAVE BEEN -IDLE- AGAIN!!!Yeah, you recalled that Morningsir likes to fly when he's looking foran inspiration... You better wait and try later, you might not catchhim talking when he's here.",0,0,0,0,})
rooms_short ({"Large open plains.","Above the valley","Mountains of Tislagsux","On the Sun","...seems as hole?","At the airport",0,0,0,0,})
