items ({0,0,({"Sign","You read the bloody paint on the broken sign: Die!!!!!!!!!!!!!!","stains","Awesome blood stains. In one of them you noticed a shit.","shit","Geeee, when will you stop searching for garbage and shit???","forest","This is a normal forest which can be seen in a forest-museum.",}),({"sun","Aaaaaarrrgh! You are BLINDED by the sunshine! Now you can't see you silly!","mirror","You look in the mirror and you see a nigga showing you his fried friggin head","ass","You hear a bone cracking as you bend yourself to see in your ass. You failed!","workroom","Look AT something, or what?","exit","You moved your head so as to see the exit but you were just blinded by the Sun","myself","You can see a shit burning happily on your ass, good appetite",}),0,0,0,0,0,0,})
